            stem: "(a) Give the most likely reason his CA 19-9 is undetectable despite a suspicious stricture and jaundice. (b) Using Table 2 and the supplementary information, interpret his CEA. (c) What is the next step to establish the diagnosis, and why can the markers not replace it?",
